	(text "Off-board HV interfaces (D021/D024). J401 DC input tap; J402/J403 chassis precharge resistor loop (R401 excluded from board);\nJ404 return of chassis discharge bank R421-R424 (excluded from board) into Q403 drain; J405 DC_BUS_N tap.\nBleeder R411-R414, divider and flyback taps stay on-board on the DC_BUS_P / DC_BUS_N nets behind J403/J405.\nTerminal footprint: M4 ring-lug pad (Pad_Via); final 6.3 mm FASTON / lug P/N at BOM [TBV]."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 33.02 190.5 0)
		(effects
